{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50282","headline":"被蕃军中拘系之作 · 马云奇","name":"被蕃军中拘系之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事逐漂蓬，悠悠过凿空！世穷途运荣（蹇），战苦不成功。\n泪滴东流水，心遥北翥鸿。\n可能忠孝节，长遣门阃（困）西戎。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马云奇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}